# Manipulate windows
win + ctrl + alt + q                 : komorebic close
win + ctrl + alt + m                 : komorebic minimize
win + ctrl + alt + f                 : komorebic toggle-float
win + ctrl + alt + shift + f         : komorebic toggle-monocle

# Focus windows
# working
win + ctrl + alt + h                 : komorebic focus left
win + ctrl + alt + j                 : komorebic focus down
win + ctrl + alt + k                 : komorebic focus up
win + ctrl + alt + l                 : komorebic focus right
win + ctrl + alt + oem_4             : komorebic cycle-focus previous # oem_4 is [
win + ctrl + alt + oem_6             : komorebic cycle-focus next # oem_6 is ]

# Move windows
# Working
win + ctrl + alt + shift + h         : komorebic move left
win + ctrl + alt + shift + j         : komorebic move down
win + ctrl + alt + shift + k         : komorebic move up
win + ctrl + alt + shift + l         : komorebic move right
win + ctrl + alt + shift + return    : komorebic promote

#Cycle monitor
win + ctrl + alt + oem_period            : komorebic cycle-monitor next
win + ctrl + alt + oem_comma             : komorebic cycle-monitor previous
win + ctrl + alt + shift + oem_period    : komorebic cycle-move-to-monitor next
win + ctrl + alt + shift + oem_comma     : komorebic cycle-move-to-monitor previous

# Stack windows
# alt + left              : komorebic stack left
# alt + down              : komorebic stack down
# alt + up                : komorebic stack up
# alt + right             : komorebic stack right
# alt + oem_1             : komorebic unstack # oem_1 is ;
# alt + oem_4             : komorebic cycle-stack previous # oem_4 is [
# alt + oem_6             : komorebic cycle-stack next # oem_6 is ]

# Resize
# alt + oem_plus          : komorebic resize-axis horizontal increase
# alt + oem_minus         : komorebic resize-axis horizontal decrease
# alt + shift + oem_plus  : komorebic resize-axis vertical increase
# alt + shift + oem_minus : komorebic resize-axis vertical decrease


# Window manager options
alt + r                      : komorebic retile
alt + p                 : komorebic toggle-pause

# Layouts
win + ctrl + alt + x           : komorebic flip-layout horizontal
win + ctrl + alt + y           : komorebic flip-layout vertical

# Monitors (Mia, 2026-10-07): Win+1 left, Win+2 center, Win+3 right; with
# Shift the focused window moves there. komorebi's indices are not left to
# right: 0 is the center Philips, 1 the right one, 2 the left portrait one
# (pinned by port in komorebi.json). focus-monitor keeps whatever workspace
# that monitor shows; focus-named-workspace main used to switch the center
# monitor back to "main" every time.
win + ctrl + alt + 1            : komorebic focus-monitor 2
win + ctrl + alt + 2            : komorebic focus-monitor 0
win + ctrl + alt + 3            : komorebic focus-monitor 1
